			<br />
			The accrued interest to be paid by successful bidders on the issue date (October 22, 2026) for the tender amount is HK$ 390.82 per minimum denomination of HK$50,000.<br />
			<br />
			(The accrued interest to be paid for tender amount exceeding HK$50,000 may not be exactly equal to the figures calculated from the accrued interest per minimum denomination of HK$50,000 due to rounding).</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
